-- GENERATED by scripts/mssql/genbase from a fresh MySQL install; do not edit by hand.
-- It equals the MySQL schema at the head below. Every migration added after it is
-- written for both databases: migrations/config/mysql/NNNN_x.sql and its twin
-- migrations/config/mssql/NNNN_x.sql (internal/dal/mssql parity_twins_test.go).
